---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
import Badge from "./Badge.astro";
import "../styles/restored-sections.css";
import "../styles/review-approved.css";
---
<Section class="ag-secpad" data-screen-label="Founder story" hidden="" id="section-31" style="background: var(--th-bg-1); padding: var(--section-pad-y) 0; display: flex; justify-content: center;"><div class="ag-interop" style="width: min(1072px, 100%); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 420px 1fr; gap: 72px; padding: 0px 28px; text-align: left; align-items: center;"><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;"><Badge style="align-self: flex-start;">From the team</Badge><blockquote style="margin: 0px; font: 300 30px/1.3 var(--font-display); color: var(--th-text-hi); text-wrap: pretty;">“I built our SEO process with an Agenta coworker. It now researches, drafts, and prepares the pull request. I spend about 20 minutes reviewing each article.”</blockquote><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;"><img alt="Mahmoud Mabrouk" src="/assets/review/2e1ab836203a9b35.webp" style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; box-shadow: var(--shadow-ring);"/><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px;"><span style="font: var(--text-label); color: var(--th-text-hi);">Mahmoud Mabrouk</span><span style="font: var(--text-body-sm); color: var(--th-text-mut);">Co-founder, Agenta</span>
</div>
</div>
</div><div style="border-radius: 12px; background: var(--ios-card-bg); box-shadow: var(--ios-card-shadow); display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding: 26px 28px;"><span style="font: var(--text-caption); letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ios-label);">Build the process once</span><span style="font: var(--text-body-md); color: var(--th-text-hi); text-wrap: pretty;">“We worked through the first article together and saved the process for the next one.”</span>
</div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding: 26px 28px; border-top: 1px solid var(--ios-row-rule);"><span style="font: var(--text-caption); letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ios-label);">Improve through feedback</span><span style="font: var(--text-body-md); color: var(--th-text-hi); text-wrap: pretty;">“My feedback on positioning and structure carries into later drafts.”</span>
</div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding: 26px 28px; border-top: 1px solid var(--ios-row-rule);"><span style="font: var(--text-caption); letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ios-label);">Keep the final review</span><span style="font: var(--text-body-md); color: var(--th-text-hi); text-wrap: pretty;">“I review the brief and final draft, then check the pull request before publishing.”</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</Section>
